                <head>No. 442<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Prime Minister Churchill and
                    President Eisenhower met in
                    Washington June 25–29, to discuss problems of mutual concern. For documentation
                    on their meetings, see <ref target="#d454">Documents 454</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
